#: ../../src/timer.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_timer_t` --- Timer handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_timer_t` —— Timer 句柄"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:7
msgid "Timer handles are used to schedule callbacks to be called in the future."
msgstr "Timer 句柄用于安排回调在将来被调用。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:9
msgid ""
"Timers are either single-shot or repeating. Repeating timers do not "
"adjust for overhead but are rearmed relative to the event loop's idea of "
"\"now\"."
msgstr ""
"定时器要么是一次性的，要么是重复的。重复定时器不会根据开销进行调整，而是"
"相对于事件循环所认定的“现在”重新装载。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:12
msgid ""
"Libuv updates its idea of \"now\" right before executing timer callbacks,"
" and right after waking up from waiting for I/O. See also "
":c:func:`uv_update_time`."
msgstr ""
"libuv 会在执行定时器回调之前、以及从 I/O 等待中唤醒之后，立即更新它对"
"“现在”的认知。另请参阅 :c:func:`uv_update_time`。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:15
msgid ""
"Example: a repeating timer with a 50 ms interval whose callback takes 17 "
"ms to complete, runs again 33 ms later. If other tasks take longer than "
"33 ms, the timer callback runs as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"示例：一个间隔为 50 ms 的重复定时器，其回调需要 17 ms 才能完成，会在 "
"33 ms 后再次运行。如果其他任务耗时超过 33 ms，定时器回调会尽快运行。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:20
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:24
msgid "Timer handle type."
msgstr "Timer 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:28
msgid "Type definition for callback passed to :c:func:`uv_timer_start`."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_timer_start` 的回调的类型定义。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:32
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:34
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:36
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:40
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:44
msgid "Initialize the handle."
msgstr "初始化句柄。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:48
msgid "Start the timer. `timeout` and `repeat` are in milliseconds."
msgstr "启动定时器。`timeout` 和 `repeat` 以毫秒为单位。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:50
msgid ""
"If `timeout` is zero, the callback fires on the next event loop "
"iteration. If `repeat` is non-zero, the callback fires first after "
"`timeout` milliseconds and then repeatedly after `repeat` milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"如果 `timeout` 为零，回调会在下一次事件循环迭代时触发。如果 `repeat` 非"
"零，回调会先在 `timeout` 毫秒后触发，然后每隔 `repeat` 毫秒重复触发。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:55
msgid ""
"Does not update the event loop's concept of \"now\". See "
":c:func:`uv_update_time` for more information."
msgstr ""
"不会更新事件循环对“现在”的概念。更多信息参见 :c:func:`uv_update_time`。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:57
msgid "If the timer is already active, it is simply updated."
msgstr "如果定时器已经处于活动状态，则只是对其进行更新。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:61
msgid "Stop the timer, the callback will not be called anymore."
msgstr "停止定时器，回调将不再被调用。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:65
msgid ""
"Stop the timer, and if it is repeating restart it using the repeat value "
"as the timeout. If the timer has never been started before it returns "
"UV_EINVAL."
msgstr ""
"停止定时器，如果它是重复定时器，则以 repeat 值作为超时值重新启动它。如果"
"该定时器从未被启动过，则返回 UV_EINVAL。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:71
msgid ""
"Set the repeat interval value in milliseconds. The timer will be "
"scheduled to run on the given interval, regardless of the callback "
"execution duration, and will follow normal timer semantics in the case of"
" a time-slice overrun."
msgstr ""
"以毫秒为单位设置重复间隔值。无论回调执行时长如何，定时器都会按给定间隔被"
"调度运行；在发生时间片超限的情况下，将遵循正常的定时器语义。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:77
msgid ""
"If the repeat value is set from a timer callback it does not immediately "
"take effect. If the timer was non-repeating before, it will have been "
"stopped. If it was repeating, then the old repeat value will have been "
"used to schedule the next timeout."
msgstr ""
"如果在定时器回调中设置 repeat 值，它不会立即生效。如果该定时器之前不是重"
"复定时器，那么它已被停止。如果之前是重复定时器，那么下一次超时会按旧的 "
"repeat 值来调度。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:83
msgid "Get the timer repeat value."
msgstr "获取定时器的 repeat 值。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:87
msgid ""
"Get the timer due value or 0 if it has expired. The time is relative to "
":c:func:`uv_now`."
msgstr "获取定时器的到期值，若已到期则为 0。该时间相对于 :c:func:`uv_now`。"

#: ../../src/timer.rst:92
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"
